---
import { EVENT_NOT_THIS } from '@lib/event-landing';

/**
 * "Was der Männerkreis nicht ist" — the section that catches the sceptics.
 *
 * Boundaries only: naming what this is not is what makes it safe to try. Nothing
 * here devalues therapy or coaching; the closing line points at professional
 * help where professional help is the right answer.
 *
 * Dark surface on purpose — it is the one moment on this page that speaks in a
 * flat, declarative voice, and the change of ground marks that.
 */
---

<section class="section event-landing-not" aria-labelledby="nicht-title">
  <div class="event-landing-not__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="event-landing-not__layout">
      <div class="section-header section-header--start section-header--on-dark" data-reveal-group>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--secondary" data-reveal="up">Klar gesagt</p>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--light" id="nicht-title" data-reveal="blur">
          Was der Männerkreis <span class="text-italic">nicht</span> ist
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="event-landing-not__body">
        <ul class="event-landing-not__list" role="list" data-reveal-group="70">
          {
            EVENT_NOT_THIS.map((item) => (
              <li class="event-landing-not__item" data-reveal="up">
                {item}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>

        <div class="event-landing-not__close" data-reveal="up">
          <p>
            Wir sitzen als Männer zusammen, hören einander zu und teilen Erfahrungen. Jeder bleibt für sich selbst
            verantwortlich.
          </p>
          <p>
            Wenn du therapeutische Unterstützung brauchst, ist professionelle Hilfe der richtige Weg. Das eine ersetzt
            das andere nicht.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  @layer sections {
    .event-landing-not {
      --_surface-noise-opacity: 0.03;

      position: relative;
      overflow: clip;
      color: var(--text-on-dark);
      background: var(--bg-dark);
    }

    .event-landing-not__glow {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: radial-gradient(
        ellipse 70% 60% at 15% 0%,
        color-mix(in oklch, var(--accent-primary) 14%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 55%
      );
    }

    .event-landing-not__layout {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
      align-items: start;

      @media (width <= 900px) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .event-landing-not .section-header {
      margin-block-end: 0;
    }

    .event-landing-not__list {
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .event-landing-not__item {
      padding-block: var(--space-sm);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 1.1rem + 1.2vw, 2rem);
      line-height: 1.25;
      color: var(--text-on-dark);
      border-block-end: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
      text-wrap: pretty;

      &:first-child {
        padding-block-start: 0;
      }
    }

    .event-landing-not__close {
      max-inline-size: var(--content-max-description);
      margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
      font-size: var(--text-section-body);
      line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
      color: var(--color-sand);
      text-wrap: pretty;

      & p {
        margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
      }

      & p:last-child {
        margin-block-end: 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
